# Map custom extension to Protocol Buffer
*.protobuf linguist-language=Protocol Buffer

# In case you also have .proto, make sure they’re counted
*.proto linguist-detectable=true

# Golden test fixtures are compared byte-for-byte, so git must not rewrite them
# on checkout. Without this, git's default core.autocrlf=true on Windows turns
# every committed LF into CRLF and the comparison fails on the line ending alone
# — which is what the windows-latest and windows-11-arm CI jobs would have hit.
#
# The case .proto files are pinned too, not just the expected output: doc
# comments are read out of the proto source and forwarded into generated output,
# so a CRLF checkout of an input file can put a stray \r inside a golden line
# rather than only at the end of one.
golden/testdata/** text eol=lf
